OL,3,GNEWSAHomeless charity offers young
OL,4,Apeople stability
OL,5,
OL,6,FA homeless organisation helping young
OL,7,Fpeople with the tools they need to live
OL,8,Findependently.
OL,10,FCharlie, 20, was living in emergency
OL,11,Faccommodation, provided by Cornwall
OL,12,FCouncil after being homeless for about
OL,13,Ftwo weeks.
OL,15,FHe was contacted by charity Young Men's
OL,16,FChristian Association (YMCA) Cornwall,
OL,17,Fbased in Penzance, who offer young
OL,18,Fpeople aged 16 to 24 years old
OL,19,Fsupported housing, advice and "life
OL,20,Fskills".
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
