OL,3,GNEWSAHomeless charity offers young
OL,4,Apeople stability
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharlie, who has been living in a small
OL,7,Fflat for about one year courtesy of the
OL,8,Fcharity, said: "It was refreshing to
OL,9,Ffinally have that stability and
OL,10,Fsupport."
